OL,3,GNEWSAHidden illegal poker den on
OL,4,Aindustrial estate discovered by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been sentenced for their
OL,7,Finvolvement in an unlicensed gambling
OL,8,Fden on an industrial estate in Cardiff.
OL,10,FNoor Rassam, 29, and Panayiotis
OL,11,FKarayiannis, 30, both from Pontprennau,
OL,12,FCardiff, operated illegal poker games
OL,13,Ffrom an upstairs room in an industrial
OL,14,Funit in Splott between August 2022 and
OL,15,FFebruary 2024.
OL,17,FThe room had been fitted out with six
OL,18,Fpoker tables, a large prize wheel,
OL,19,Fseating areas, and fridges stocked with
OL,20,Fdrinks and snacks.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
