OL,3,GNEWSAHidden illegal poker den on
OL,4,Aindustrial estate discovered by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 2 October, the pair appeared at
OL,7,FCardiff Crown Court for possessing and
OL,8,Ftransferring criminal funds obtained by
OL,9,Frunning the den and received a
OL,10,Fsuspended sentence. A Proceeds of Crime
OL,11,FAct hearing has been set for April next
OL,12,Fyear.
